# RTL8733BU combo chip: soft-block BT before suspend. btusb stays loaded —
# the rtl8733bu-power driver drops the chip GPIO when both wifi and bt
# rfkills are blocked, which cleanly disconnects the USB device (firing
# btusb/8733bu .disconnect callbacks for us). Unloading btusb directly
# while 8733bu is active would break the shared USB device.

rfkill block bluetooth 2>/dev/null
